==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The swarm of Dark Otters can be easily taken down with [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. However, he can't outrange the Condemned Pengs, so you'll want to bring a unit like [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]] as well. All the dangerous enemies are limited, so you just have to outlast them in order to win.

